L000512	Fermi satellite~\cite{Fermi-LAT:2015kyq} (purple line). The limits from dwarf spheroidal galaxy observations with HAWC~\cite{HAWC:2019jvm} (grey line), H.E.S.S.~\cite{HESS:2020zwn} (green line), MAGIC~\cite{MAGIC:2021mog} (yellow line) and VERITAS~\cite{VERITAS:2017tif} (pink line) are also
